127,128 $ Fumarprotocetraric acid major, protocetraric acid minor
127,129 $ Protocetraric acid major
128,0 $ Thallus grey, moderately thick, rimose-areolate, irregularly fine- to coarse-warted, with almost concolorous, coarse soralia on viz. between the warts; soralia yellowish white, 0.5-0.8 mm wide; fumarprotocetraric, tr. protocetraric acids; on granite in Rumania $  P. erumpens Erichsen
